---
---

<section id="strengths" class="scroll-mt-20 px-6 py-16 md:py-20">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-4xl">
    <div class="mx-auto mb-12 max-w-[520px] text-center">
      <span
        class="mb-2.5 block text-sm font-bold tracking-[0.12em] text-[#6B8E23]"
        >WHAT I CAN DO</span
      >
      <h2 class="text-[26px] md:text-[34px]">対応できること</h2>
    </div>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-5 md:grid-cols-3">
      <div
        class="flex flex-col gap-4 rounded-[28px] bg-white p-7 shadow-[0_18px_40px_-26px_rgba(70,110,80,0.3)]"
      >
        <div
          class="flex h-13 w-13 items-center justify-center rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-br from-[#DCEFD9] to-[#A9D68B]"
        >
          <svg
            width="24"
            height="24"
            viewBox="0 0 24 24"
            fill="none"
            stroke="#3F6B2E"
            stroke-width="2"
            stroke-linecap="round"
            stroke-linejoin="round"
            ><path
              d="M9.5 2a5.5 5.5 0 0 0-4 9.3A4 4 0 0 0 8 18h1"></path><path
              d="M14.5 2a5.5 5.5 0 0 1 4 9.3A4 4 0 0 1 16 18h-1"
            ></path><path d="M9 18v2a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h2a2 2 0 0 0 2-2v-2"
            ></path></svg
          >
        </div>
        <h3 class="break-keep text-lg">行動心理を活かした<wbr />商品訴求</h3>
        <p class="break-keep text-[14.5px] leading-relaxed text-[#7A6660]">
          前職の営業経験から培った<wbr />「刺さる伝え方」で、<wbr />商品の魅力を<wbr />的確に届けます。
        </p>
      </div>

      <div
        class="flex flex-col gap-4 rounded-[28px] bg-white p-7 shadow-[0_18px_40px_-26px_rgba(70,110,80,0.3)]"
      >
        <div
          class="flex h-13 w-13 items-center justify-center rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-br from-[#BFE6C9] to-[#3FA66B]"
        >
          <svg
            width="24"
            height="24"
            viewBox="0 0 24 24"
            fill="none"
            stroke="#FFFFFF"
            stroke-width="2"
            stroke-linecap="round"
            stroke-linejoin="round"
            ><path d="M9 18V5l12-2v13"></path><circle
              cx="6"
              cy="18"
              r="3"></circle><circle cx="18" cy="16" r="3"></circle></svg
          >
        </div>
        <h3 class="break-keep text-lg">歌リール形式の<wbr />PR動画制作</h3>
        <p class="break-keep text-[14.5px] leading-relaxed text-[#7A6660]">
          耳に残る歌とリールを<wbr />組み合わせた、<wbr />記憶に残るPR動画を<wbr />制作できます。
        </p>
      </div>

      <div
        class="flex flex-col gap-4 rounded-[28px] bg-white p-7 shadow-[0_18px_40px_-26px_rgba(70,110,80,0.3)]"
      >
        <div
          class="flex h-13 w-13 items-center justify-center rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-br from-[#EAF4C0] to-[#9CC24C]"
        >
          <svg
            width="24"
            height="24"
            viewBox="0 0 24 24"
            fill="none"
            stroke="#4B5E1E"
            stroke-width="2"
            stroke-linecap="round"
            stroke-linejoin="round"
            ><path d="M3 11.5 12 4l9 7.5"></path><path
              d="M5 10v9a1 1 0 0 0 1 1h4v-6h4v6h4a1 1 0 0 0 1-1v-9"
            ></path></svg
          >
        </div>
        <h3 class="break-keep text-lg">
          暮らし便利グッズジャンル<wbr />での発信経験
        </h3>
        <p class="break-keep text-[14.5px] leading-relaxed text-[#7A6660]">
          「暮らしの便利グッズ」という<wbr />得意ジャンルに絞った<wbr />発信実績があります。
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
